# Painted Village's bindings for coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (NAME GROUP BINDING [uniform VEC4FS]), as coax/web/host.js lays them out:
# group 0 the frame's uniforms (aethyr/render/stylized-layout.coax: 196 floats); group 1 the scene's stores: the kit's
# vertices, the records, the ground table; group 2 the sun's shadow map and its comparison sampler.
u 0 0 uniform 49
mesh 1 0
objects 1 1
heights 1 2
shadow_map 2 0
shadow_cmp 2 1
